# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  NLI-Thai / BDI — Environment Template
#
#  Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in any keys you have:
#      cp .env.template .env.local      (macOS/Linux)
#      Copy-Item .env.template .env.local   (PowerShell)
#
#  PLUG & PLAY: every variable is OPTIONAL. Any key you leave blank falls back
#  to built-in MOCK data, so the app runs end-to-end even with an empty file.
#  Fill a key in → that feature switches to REAL data automatically.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Map tiles (MapTiler) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Client-side key — NEXT_PUBLIC_ is exposed to the browser (the map renders there).
# Get a free key: https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
# If blank, the map falls back to a shared demo key with limited quota.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_API_KEY=

# ── LLM / GIS Assistant (Google AI — Gemini) ─────────────────────────────────
# Server-side only. Powers the "Typhoon LLM" assistant via Genkit.
# Get a key: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# If blank, the assistant returns built-in mock responses (shown as "Demo Mode").
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ── (Optional, future) Unified geospatial backend — PostGIS / Supabase ───────
# For SCAMTIR detections + citizen complaints sharing one map (EPSG:4326).
# Leave blank until the spatial backend is provisioned.
# DATABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
